
*******************************************************************************
* ZX Spectrum Development environment on a VM                                 *
*******************************************************************************

Default Users (SSH & Console login):

        * sysadmin / Passw0rd  - sudo enabled user, for system administration
             tasks.

        * zxdvel / Passw0rd - Development user, should be used for all
             development work and testing. Might be enabled to shutdown or
             reboot VM (to be done!!!).


